<%--
Form_Field_Abstract

Abstract base component for form field wrappers. Provides core functionality without visual formatting.
Extend this to create custom form field wrappers with different visual styles.

$name - Field name (required) - used for form serialization and error display
$label - Label text (optional) - available for child classes to display
$required - Boolean (optional) - available for child classes to indicate required fields
$help - Help text (optional) - available for child classes to display

Child content is the form widget (Text_Input, Select_Input, etc.)

Note: This is an abstract component. Use Form_Field for standard formatted fields,
or extend this to create custom field wrappers.
--%>
<Define:Form_Field_Abstract>
    <%= content() %>
</Define:Form_Field_Abstract>